rning unrelated pair computation to serial execution. Why checks miss it: the pressure scene enables custom filtering on every shape, so all accepted survivors enter the same deferred stream; the work-oracle pair test has only 300 sparse unflagged contacts and a distant flagged shape, with no accepted deferred candidate and no capacity pressure. Neither mixes accepted deferred and unflagged survivors beyond capacity. Independently examined all three correction diffs, their regressions/work oracle, pair list merging and emission, CCD probe/deferred completion boundaries, contact recycle and mesh dispatch, exception completion, and the shared-instance guard. Only the mixed-capacity doubt was run; no full-suite or timing rerun, no edits or commits. Remaining uncertainty: no new native oracle scene was authored or run; the red uses true-filter versus null-filter equivalence established directly by the pinned Box3D pair callback and allocation sequence.
